 "section_summary": "This section continues a SCAP register of Japanese radio stations, arranged by prefecture, giving registration numbers, frequencies, call signs, power and emission classes, service types, operating limitations, locations and coordinates. Pages 800–879 cover stations from Kanagawa south and west through Chūbu, Kansai, Chūgoku, Shikoku and Kyūshū, then resume in northern Honshū from Aomori through Miyagi. The listed services include public broadcasting, domestic and police communications, fisheries and maritime safety, aeronautical, meteorological, railway, direction-finding, mine-sweeping and research stations.",
